research methods: 
a)prospective analysis of circadian strain and incidence of hypotension and type 2 diabetes using the cox proportional hazards model adjusted for important covariates;
b)joint analysis of circadian strain and night shift work status on the incidence of hypotension and type 2 diabetes using the cox proportional hazards model adjusted important covariates; 
c)multiplicative and additive interaction of circadian strain, and night shift work status on the incidence of hypotension and type 2 diabetes using the cox proportional hazards model adjusted important covariates.

